d}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{x}{\\int }_{0}^{x+y}6{y}^{2}\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{x}[{\\int }_{0}^{x+y}6{y}^{2}\\,dz]dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{x}[6{y}^{2}z]_{z=0}^{z=x+y}\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{x}6{y}^{2}(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{x}6x{y}^{2}+6{y}^{3}\\,dy\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $y$, treating $x$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{x}6x{y}^{2}+6{y}^{3}\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{x}6x{y}^{2}+6{y}^{3}\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[2x{y}^{3}+\\frac{3}{2}{y}^{4}]}_{y=0}^{y=x}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}2{x}^{4}+\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{4}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{7}{2}{x}^{4}\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{7}{2}{x}^{4}\\,dx & ={[\\frac{7}{10}{x}^{5}]}_{x=0}^{x=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{10}(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344160 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344161 13194139535331 true] [17592186344160 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344162 13194139535331 true] [17592186344160 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344163 13194139535331 true] [17592186344160 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344164 13194139535331 true] [17592186344160 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344165 13194139535331 true] [17592186344160 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535331 true] [17592186344160 1041 "selection" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344160 1104 #edb/ref 17592186344165 13194139535331 true] [17592186344160 1110 #uuid "04d4036c-42de-52ed-b4af-9626ee062e92" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344161 1034 "\\frac{9}{10}" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344161 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344161 1111 #uuid "e70ef1e9-2375-5a59-bab2-8a71414fe4a9" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344162 1034 "\\frac{2}{5}" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344162 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true]