espect to $y$, treating $x$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{x}12(4{x}^{2}-4xy+{y}^{2}-4x+2y)\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{x}48({x}^{2}-x)+24(1-2x)y+12{y}^{2}\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}[48({x}^{2}-x)y+12(1-2x){y}^{2}+4{y}^{3}]_{y=0}^{y=x}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}48({x}^{2}-x)x+12(1-2x){x}^{2}+4{x}^{3}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}28{x}^{3}-36{x}^{2}\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}28{x}^{3}-36{x}^{2}\\,dx & ={[7{x}^{4}-12{x}^{3}]}_{x=1}^{x=2} \\\\  & =(112-96)-(7-12) \\\\  & =21.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344167 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344168 13194139535331 true] [17592186344167 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344169 13194139535331 true] [17592186344167 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344170 13194139535331 true] [17592186344167 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344171 13194139535331 true] [17592186344167 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344172 13194139535331 true] [17592186344167 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535331 true] [17592186344167 1041 "selection" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344167 1104 #edb/ref 17592186344171 13194139535331 true] [17592186344167 1110 #uuid "241c5f6c-3a69-5db9-aeb9-b427c6e615e1" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344168 1034 "11" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344168 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344168 1111 #uuid "43750e2c-6e5d-54d7-a753-9099b025c7fd" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344169 1034 "19" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344169 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344169 1111 #uuid "eae68f6b-7c36-5bb5-8da3-b4ed356cff7e" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344170 1034 "16" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344170 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344170 1111 #uuid "57a47501-5e88-5425-ada7-bfe096ec002c" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344171 1034 "21" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344171 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344171 1111 #uuid "83fe3c7c-1809-54a1-811c-01e574c9d2d9" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344172 1034 "37" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344172 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344172 1111 #uuid "1368fc74-498e-58d4-9dd1-d87bd3813c50" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344173 1017 #edb/ref 17592186344174 13194139535331 true] [17592186344173 1089 "q-161459" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344173 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535331 true] [17592186344173 1100 "Evaluate the triple integral \n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}2z\\,dV\n$$\n\nwhere $R$ is the type I region given by \n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,1\\le x\\le 3,\\,1\\le y\\le x,\\,x\\le z\\le 1+x+y}.\n$$" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344173 1113 #uuid "2542b9c4-5254-58bd-9395-1612089457e5" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344173 1145 "Writing down our triple integral as a repeated integral, we obtain\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}2z\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{1}^{3}{\\int }_{1}^{x}{\\int }_{x}^{1+x+y}2z\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx.\n$$\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $z$, treating $x$ and $y$ as constants: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}{\\int }_{1}^{x}{\\int }_{x}^{1+x+y}2z\\,dz\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}{\\int }_{1}^{x}[{\\int }_{x}^{1+x+y}2z\\,dz]dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}{\\int }_{1}^{x}[{z}^{2}]_{z=x}^{z=1+x+y}\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}{\\int }_{1}^{x}(1+x+y)^{2}-{x}^{2}\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}{\\int }_{1}^{x}(1+y)^{2}+2x(1+y)\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}{\\int }_{1}^{x}{y}^{2}+2xy+2y+2x+1\\,dy\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $y$, treating $x$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}{\\int }_{1}^{x}({y}^{2}+2xy+2y+2x+1)\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}[{\\int }_{1}^{x}({y}^{2}+2xy+2y+2x+1)\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}{[\\frac{1}{3}{y}^{3}+x{y}^{2}+{y}^{2}+2xy+y]}_{y=1}^{y=x}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}(\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}+2{x}^{2}+x)-(\\frac{1}{3}+x+1+2x+1)\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}\\frac{4}{3}{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}-2x-\\frac{7}{3}\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}\\frac{4}{3}{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}-2x-\\frac{7}{3}\\,dx & ={[\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-\\frac{7}{3}x]}_{x=1}^{x=3} \\\\  & =(27+27-9-7)-(\\frac{1}{3}+1-1-\\frac{7}{3}) \\\\  & =40.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344174 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344175 13194139535331 true] [17592186344174 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344176 13194139535331 true] [17592186344174 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344177 13194139535331 true] [17592186344174 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344178 13194139535331 true] [17592186344174 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344179 13194139535331 true] [17592186344174 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535331 true] [17592186344174 1041 "selection" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344174 1104 #edb/ref 17592186344177 13194139535331 true] [17592186344174 1110 #uuid "ae01daaa-82a6-5ef5-b31e-c685650eb3f5" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344175 1034 "64" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344175 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344175 1111 #uuid "e50f6575-c552-5a60-be41-56ea86196c21" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344176 1034 "28" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344176 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344176 1111 #uuid "5e454d25-7b66-5868-9507-ce11c826369b" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344177 1034 "40" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344177 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344177 1111 #uuid "667c45ab-24c0-5630-a8e5-19f950a443c3" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344178 1034 "36" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344178 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344178 1111 #uuid "51a6c0c5-994b-5b62-bf35-edae61bfc293" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344179 1034 "52" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344179 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344179 1111 #uuid "53ba7d16-5399-528c-a9c5-ae42c4cb57b2" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344180 1017 #edb/ref 17592186344181 13194139535331 true] [17592186344180 1089 "q-161468" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344180 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535331 true] [17592186344180 1100 "Evaluate the mixed integral\n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{y-{x}^{2}}}z\\,dz]dA\n$$\n\nwhere the region $D$ in the $xy$-plane is given by\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 2,\\,{x}^{2}\\le y\\le 4}.\n$$" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344180 1113 #uuid "49e34b8e-62e8-59ca-9516-ef04fd81ee40" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344180 1145 "First, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $z,$ treating $x$ and $y$ as constants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{y-{x}^{2}}}z\\,dz]dA & ={∬}_{D}{[\\frac{{z}^{2}}{2}]}_{z=0}^{z=\\sqrt{y-{x}^{2}}}\\,dA \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\frac{1}{2}{(\\sqrt{y-{x}^{2}})}^{2}-0\\,dA \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\frac{1}{2}(y-{x}^{2})\\,dA\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the double integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\frac{1}{2}(y-{x}^{2})\\,dA & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{4}\\frac{1}{2}(y-{x}^{2})\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{4}y-{x}^{2}\\,dy]dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{[\\frac{1}{2}{y}^{2}-{x}^{2}y]}_{y={x}^{2}}^{y=4}dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}(16-{x}^{4})-{x}^{2}(4-{x}^{2})\\,dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}8-\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{4}-4{x}^{2}+{x}^{4}\\,dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{4}-4{x}^{2}+8\\,dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{[\\frac{1}{10}{x}^{5}-\\frac{4}{3}{x}^{3}+8x]}_{x=0}^{x=2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{20}(32-0)-\\frac{2}{3}(8-0)+4(2-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{5}-\\frac{16}{3}+8 \\\\  & =\\frac{64}{15}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344181 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344182 13194139535331 true] [17592186344181 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344183 13194139535331 true] [17592186344181 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344184 13194139535331 true] [17592186344181 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344185 13194139535331 true] [17592186344181 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344186 13194139535331 true] [17592186344181 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535331 true] [17592186344181 1041 "selection" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344181 1104 #edb/ref 17592186344185 13194139535331 true] [17592186344181 1110 #uuid "a0798a8d-f4fa-5617-b272-4edc6fe4e9f0" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344182 1034 "\\frac{7}{5}" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344182 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344182 1111 #uuid "3b6aac0e-1529-5bc1-aec3-80e5057d0d5c" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344183 1034 "\\frac{6}{7}" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344183 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344183 1111 #uuid "2fe9399f-30e4-5915-be99-8ea208a80506" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344184 1034 "\\frac{8}{3}" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344184 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344184 1111 #uuid "8663d7a6-6231-5b8e-b59c-589557f05694" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344185 1034 "\\frac{64}{15}" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344185 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344185 1111 #uuid "a33925fe-8344-5a99-988d-77b22d786014" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344186 1034 "\\frac{19}{12}" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344186 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344186 1111 #uuid "1116c08a-1ee9-5dc5-950a-ae6d6e75c8a9" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344187 1017 #edb/ref 17592186344188 13194139535331 true] [17592186344187 1089 "q-161469" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344187 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535331 true] [17592186344187 1100 "Evaluate the mixed integral\n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{y}}4{z}^{3}\\,dz]dA\n$$\n\nwhere the region $D$ in the $xy$-plane is given by\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 1-x}.\n$$" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344187 1113 #uuid "db395d38-fc06-5bcd-b6d9-88ab9d5e17dc" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344187 1145 "First, we evaluate the inner integral with respect to $z,$ treating $x$ and $y$ as constants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{y}}4{z}^{3}\\,dz]dA & ={∬}_{D}{[{z}^{4}]}_{z=0}^{z=\\sqrt{y}}\\,dA \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}({(\\sqrt{y})}^{4}-0)\\,dA \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}{y}^{2}\\,dA\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the double integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}{y}^{2}\\,dA & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1-x}{y}^{2}\\,dy\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{1-x}{y}^{2}\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[\\frac{1}{3}{y}^{3}]}_{y=0}^{y=1-x}dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{3}((1-x)^{3}-0)\\,dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(1-x)^{3}\\,dx \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{[-\\frac{1}{4}(1-x)^{4}]}_{x=0}^{x=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(0+\\frac{1}{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344188 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344189 13194139535331 true] [17592186344188 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344190 13194139535331 true] [17592186344188 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344191 13194139535331 true] [17592186344188 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344192 13194139535331 true] [17592186344188 1000 #edb/ref 17592186344193 13194139535331 true] [17592186344188 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535331 true] [17592186344188 1041 "selection" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344188 1104 #edb/ref 17592186344192 13194139535331 true] [17592186344188 1110 #uuid "e7dd5571-2f27-5b2e-9538-7cd0479b6e87" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344189 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344189 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344189 1111 #uuid "49e7226e-c42c-5fec-87ec-a799a699254a" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344190 1034 "8" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344190 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344190 1111 #uuid "f328f62b-607d-5047-b516-333a6fb75f98" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344191 1034 "2" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344191 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535331 true] [17592186344191 1111 #uuid "07a4eb1f-b182-5552-82f2-556e47e6ca65" 13194139535331 true] [17592186344192 1034 "\\frac{1}{12}" 13194139535331 true] [